  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">김정식 선생님께서 알려주신 빛의 삼원색 그림 그리기 활동을 하려고 해봤으나</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">암실이 아닌 상태에서는 특정 색상의 조명을 제어하기가 쉽지 않아</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">암실에 버금가는? 어둠상자를 만들어 보았습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">거의 암실에 가까운 환경을 조성하여 학생들의 빛그림을 관찰하기 좋도록 제작했습니다.</span></p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9945234E5DBA7BD526\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"1024\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20191023_104225.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"1024\" id=\"A_9945234E5DBA7BD526E5BB\"></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99FC3D4E5DBA7BD729\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"488\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"20191023_104240.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"488\" id=\"A_99FC3D4E5DBA7BD72976AD\"></p><p><br></p></span><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><iframe id=\"v54a6b9iiYswMNSN9kmysam\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/v54a6b9iiYswMNSN9kmysam?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InY1NGE2YjlpaVlzd01OU045a215c2FtIiwidGlkIjoiMWRmOWE4NmMtYTFiNy00Mjk4LWI1OTYtOWIyOWEwMjY5MWI2IiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTgyNzkwfQ.k_plqOfyypHdf9aLp4FuTMcq7UZQVmbGp2F9kOL3gIaZOx5IL9vBdFy8tSlINjnWJZJbigVhlP4WfF6EXMTOAg&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D265%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20191025151424&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile296.uf.daum.net%2Fimage%2F993A7D405DB2925333F05F')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_jpg_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"> 20191023_104225.jpg</a><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafe_image/cf_img2/bbs2/btn_imageview.gif' alt='첨부이미지 미리보기' onclick='albumViewer(\"viewer\", \"http://cfile296.uf.daum.net/image/993A7D405DB2925333F05F\");' class='attachedImgView' /></p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHp%26dataid%3D265%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20191025151424&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile290.uf.daum.net%2Fimage%2F991FF7405DB2926934E07B')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_jpg_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"> 20191023_104240.jpg</a><img src='https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafe_image/cf_img2/bbs2/btn_imageview.gif' alt='첨부이미지 미리보기' onclick='albumViewer(\"viewer\", \"http://cfile290.uf.daum.net/image/991FF7405DB2926934E07B\");' class='attachedImgView' /></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p></div><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
